WEBVTT

00:05:26.906 --> 00:05:30.576
with us in the face
of systemic oppressions

00:05:30.576 --> 00:05:33.204
when too often we do not
do the same for them.

00:05:34.497 --> 00:05:35.498
(Applause and cheers)

00:05:35.498 --> 00:05:40.753
(Applause)

00:05:42.088 --> 00:05:44.799
The Black Lives Matter
movement for example,

00:05:44.799 --> 00:05:50.679
founded, named and led
by queer women of color,

00:05:50.679 --> 00:05:55.267
still centers Black men’s well-being

00:05:55.267 --> 00:05:57.686
in the face of unfair policing

00:05:57.686 --> 00:05:59.105
and criminal justice systems.